
WARNING: This alpha has no authentication.
Whoever can reach the printed URL can create searches, read results,
and cancel or delete campaigns. --lan and --tunnel are opt-in.

cloudflared is not installed.
This script will not install it, will not create an account,
and will not sign anyone up.
Install cloudflared yourself if you want --tunnel, or use --lan
on the same network, or run without flags for loopback only.
